        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Corey Gibson, Corey Chorus, Rihanna, Dan Balan, Demi Lovato\n- Roles: songwriter, record producer, vocal producer, sound engineer, publisher, recording artist\n- Songs: \"Cheers (Drink to That)\", \"Chica Bomb\", \"Made in the USA\"\n- Albums: \"Loud\"\n- Places: America, Barbados\n\nFacts:\n- Corey Gibson, professionally known as Corey Chorus, is an American songwriter, record producer, vocal producer, sound engineer, and publisher.\n- Corey Chorus is known for writing songs including Rihanna's \"Cheers (Drink to That)\", Dan Balan's \"Chica Bomb\", and Demi Lovato's \"Made in the USA\".\n- Rihanna is a Barbadian recording artist.\n- \"Cheers (Drink to That)\" is a song recorded by Rihanna.\n- \"Cheers (Drink to That)\" appears on Rihanna's fifth studio album, \"Loud\", released in 2010.",
